@scottschurr w.r.t. flowcross failing with tecOversize; 

There will definitely be cases where this simpler fix fails with tecOversize where @scottschurr's other fix does not. However, this should be both a rare and short-lived condition. The order books should quickly be cleared by both other payments and offer crossing. So I don't think the cost of the extra complexity is worth the very small number of payments/offer crossings I expect it would allow to succeed.

I do welcome other options. If we decide the other fix is the way to go @scottschurr was pretty far along with it, as seen in the patch.

